    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Doyle are delighted to present 6 Cleamore Terrace to the market, a brick fronted two-bedroom terraced home ideally positioned within easy reach of Kildare Town and all its amenities.This well-located property benefits from both front and rear gardens, a garage and rear access. While the property required modernisation and decorating, this property represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike. THE PROPERTY HAS BEEN VACANT SOME YEARS AND WOULD BE ELIGIBLE FOR THE VACANT PROPERTY REFURBISHMENT GRANT OF UP TO 50,000, subject to the purchasers meeting the eligibility criteria. The accommodation briefly comprises of living room, two internal hallways, kitchen/dining room, two bedrooms and a bathroom.The location is superb, with everything you need within walking distance. Kildare Town offers a wide range of everyday amenities, including Tesco, Lidl and Aldi supermarkets, as well as cafés, restaurants, boutiques, churches and crèches. The town also benefits from excellent transport links to Dublin, making it an ideal choice for commuters. Viewing of this property comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room : - 3.476m x 4.509m\nFacing to front, solid wood flooring, da do rail and feature fireplace with cast iron inset, coving and ceiling light.\n\n- - \n\n\nInner Hall : - \nWood flooring, access to stairs.\n\n- - \n\n\nKitchen Dining Room: - 4.536m x 3.495m\nFacing to rear, kitchen units, stainless steel sink unit, part tiled walls, stanely stove, hot press with shelving and immersion.\n\n- - \n\n\nRear Hall : - \nTiled floor, access to rear garden.\n\n- - \n\n\nBathroom : - 1.024m x 2.603m\nPart tiled walls, tiled floor, w.c., w.h.b., bath and window.\n\n- - \n\n\nLanding : - \nWindow for natural light.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 1 : - 3.487m x 2.709m\nDouble to front. Cast iron fireplace.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 2 : - 2.666m x 2.709m\nSpacious room facing to rear. Built in wardrobes.\n\n- - \n\n\nOutside : - \nWalled front garden leading to front door. Rear garden with fence and laid to lawn.\n\n- - \n\n\nGarage : - 6.678m x 3.360m\nGarage to rear has both vehicular and pedestrian access from the rear. Ideal for a variety of uses. ESB and up and over door.\n\n- - \n\n\nDisclaimer : - \nThe above are issued by DNG Doyle Naas on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars which are issued for guidance purposes only and neither the form nor the agent holds themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. The purchaser is advised to make their own arrangements to satisfy themselves with measurements, details and contents include conditions.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 2 bed brick fronted mid terrace property</li><li> Front and rear gardens</li><li> OFCH</li><li> Garage</li><li> Located in heart of Kildare Town</li><li> Communting distance of Dublin</ul>"
      },
